# The reading-girl statue found in many Korean schoolyards, from the school
# ghost story where it moves at night. Stone colours only; the eyes light up
# when it looks at you. still -> look -> reach. Front view.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 24 40
@output ../characters/creature_reading_statue.png
@preview ../previews/creature_reading_statue_x4.png 4
@columns 3

